56 | // AuthBootstrapMethods is the subset of PublicMethods that stays reachable by
57 | // anonymous callers even when the instance access mode is PRIVATE.
58 | //
59 | // It is the minimum required to render the sign-in page, authenticate, and follow
60 | // share links, and register when instance settings permit it. Every entry here
61 | // MUST also exist in PublicMethods.
62 | var AuthBootstrapMethods = map[string]struct{}{
